l listen to a mechanic and a trainee check the store, then answer questions.","ar":"هذا الجزء الثالث، في مخزن القطع. ستستمع إلى ميكانيكي ومتدرّب يفحصان المخزن، ثمّ تجيب عن أسئلة."},"id":"L002"},{"actor":"nabil","start":15.79,"text":{"en":"Before you listen: what parts does a service department keep in the store?","ar":"قبل أن تستمع: ما القطع التي يحفظها قسم الخدمة في المخزن؟"},"id":"L003"},{"actor":"nabil","start":20.868,"text":{"en":"Tarek, are there any oil filters in the store?","ar":"طارق، هل هناك أيّ فلاتر زيت في المخزن؟"},"id":"L004"},{"actor":"tarek","start":24.602,"text":{"en":"Let me check. There are three oil filters, but there aren't any air filters.","ar":"دعني أتحقّق. هناك ثلاثة فلاتر زيت، لكن ليس هناك أيّ فلاتر هواء."},"id":"L005"},{"actor":"nabil","start":31.24,"text":{"en":"How much coolant is there?","ar":"كم سائل تبريد هناك؟"},"id":"L006"},{"actor":"tarek","start":34.11,"text":{"en":"There isn't much - only one bottle.","ar":"ليس هناك كثير - عبوة واحدة فقط."},"id":"L007"},{"actor":"nabil","start":37.604,"text":{"en":"OK. Please order some air filters and more coolant.","ar":"حسناً. اطلب بعض فلاتر الهواء والمزيد من سائل التبريد."},"id":"L008"},{"actor":"tarek","start":42.946,"text":{"en":"Yes, Ustaz. I'll tell Maher.","ar":"نعم، أستاذ. سأخبر ماهر."},"id":"L009"},{"actor":"nabil","start":47.448,"text":{"en":"How many oil filters are there?","ar":"كم فلتر زيت هناك؟"},"subHold":7.392,"id":"L010"},{"actor":"nabil","start":54.84,"text":{"en":"Three.","ar":"ثلاثة."},"id":"L011"},{"actor":"nabil","start":57.062,"text":{"en":"Are there any air filters?","ar":"هل هناك أيّ فلاتر هواء؟"},"subHold":6.737,"id":"L012"},{"actor":"nabil","start":63.799,"text":{"en":"No, there aren't any.","ar":"لا، ليس هناك أيّ منها."},"id":"L013"},{"actor":"nabil","start":66.549,"text":{"en":"What must Tarek order?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يطلب طارق؟"},"subHold":6.598,"id":"L014"},{"actor":"nabil","start":73.147,"text":{"en":"Air filters and more coolant.","ar":"فلاتر هواء والمزيد من سائل التبريد."},"id":"L015"},{"actor":"tarek","start":76.185,"text":{"en":"Useful phrases: Are there any? How much? There aren't any.","ar":"عبارات مفيدة: هل هناك أيّ؟ كم؟ ليس هناك أيّ."},"id":"L016"},{"actor":"nabil","start":82.895,"text":{"en":"Now, a few more words from this unit. Look at each thing before I say its name.","ar":"الآن، بعض الكلمات الأخرى من هذه الوحدة. انظر إلى كلّ شيء قبل أن أقول اسمه."},"id":"L017"},{"actor":"nabil","start":89.677,"text":{"en":"This is engine oil. We keep it in the store.","ar":"هذا زيت المحرّك. نحفظه في المخزن."},"id":"L018"},{"actor":"nabil","start":94.251,"text":{"en":"This is brake fluid. We keep it in the store too.","ar":"هذا زيت الفرامل. نحفظه في المخزن أيضاً."},"id":"L019"},{"actor":"nabil","start":99.185,"text":{"en":"This is a battery. It is a part we order often.","ar":"هذه بطارية. قطعة نطلبها كثيراً."},"id":"L020"},{"actor":"nabil","start":103.879,"text":{"en":"This is a radiator. It is a bigger part.","ar":"هذا راديتير. قطعة أكبر."},"id":"L021"}],"subtitles":{"enabled":true,"langs":"en,ar","show":null,"lang":{}},"badgePlacement":{"x":"0.016","y":"0.016","width":"0.205"},"audio":{"master":"audio.m4a","lines":[{"key":"083824c8d6aad25b","bytes":38016,"sha":"74f8de2430dfa199","address":"lines/083824c8d6aad25b.mp3"},{"key":"f0638bff1ed0835a","bytes":49824,"sha":"0d100d7a1595c0f2","address":"lines/f0638bff1ed0835a.mp3"},{"key":"fe28d82a65c5151c","bytes":28368,"sha":"d6c10b5ccbd841d0","address":"lines/fe28d82a65c5151c.mp3"},{"key":"8cfebcc65b88e354","bytes":20304,"sha":"4ababf85e2876d92","address":"lines/8cfebcc65b88e354.mp3"},{"key":"7b2f7c861b39a100","bytes":37728,"sha":"f34477e18248cc66","address":"lines/7b2f7c861b39a100.mp3"},{"key":"8bc9d377b303fd9f","bytes":15120,"sha":"7d83b00d96a0c660","address":"lines/8bc9d377b303fd9f.mp3"},{"key":"a690f9dd90fce7c0","bytes":18864,"sha":"905f38e026687455","address":"lines/a690f9dd90fce7c0.mp3"},{"key":"136230454a055f3c","bytes":29952,"sha":"ea35f30c519b0ac5","address":"lines/13623045